# USAFCACARS Releases Repository
# Public documentation and release-metadata repository.
#
# Installers, portable archives, symbols, and other binary release packages
# should be uploaded as GitHub Release assets instead of committed to normal
# Git history.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating-system files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

